External services
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MusicBrainz (metadata suggestions, optional, operator-triggered): data is
CC0 / CC BY-NC-SA per https://musicbrainz.org/doc/About/Data_License;
requests follow the MusicBrainz rate limit (1/s) with an identifying
User-Agent.

Music played on air requires the station's own broadcast/performance
licenses (e.g. BUMA/STEMRA, SENA in the Netherlands); this software does not
provide them.
